{"id":"wb-6-623","name":"阎庄圣寿寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"阎庄圣寿寺塔","text":"阎庄圣寿寺塔，简称圣寿寺塔，因建于原圣寿寺内得名。位于中华人民共和国河南省商丘市睢县后台乡闫庄村，1963年被列为河南省文物保护单位，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位，为睢县唯一的全国重点文物保护单位。\n圣寿寺塔建于北宋，为六角九级密檐式砖塔，全高22米（一说19.25米），底部周长28.4米，中华人民共和国成立后曾于1985年进行过修缮。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%8E%E5%BA%84%E5%9C%A3%E5%AF%BF%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":88075104,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88075104","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8481439874a490c42940e318.jpg","title":"20220727_Pagoda_of_Shengshou_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20220727_Pagoda_of_Shengshou_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/20220727_Pagoda_of_Shengshou_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Pagoda of Shengshou Temple","width":320,"height":480}}